<section class="premium-page" style="padding: 120px 0 80px; min-height: 70vh; display: flex; align-items: flex-start;">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width: 800px; width: 100%;">
    <div class="glass-panel leak-top-pink" style="padding: 60px 40px; position: relative; border-radius: 16px;">
      <div class="brickwall" style="opacity: 0.1;"></div>
      <div style="position: relative; z-index: 2;">
        <h1 style="font-family: var(--heading); color: var(--ivory); font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 48px); margin: 0 0 32px; line-height: 1.1; text-align: center;">Policies &amp; Guarantees</h1>
        <div class="rte" style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;">
          <h2 style="color: var(--ivory); font-family: var(--heading); font-size: 32px;">Shipping &amp; Returns</h2>
          <p>We ship all over India. Each sign is securely packaged to prevent damage during transit. If your sign arrives damaged, contact us within 48 hours for a replacement.</p>
          <br>
          <h2 style="color: var(--ivory); font-family: var(--heading); font-size: 32px;">Warranty Information</h2>
          <p>We stand by our craftsmanship. All our neon signs come with a 2-year warranty covering electrical failures. (Note: Warranty does not cover physical damage caused after delivery).</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Why Page",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
